# CDN Distribution Monitoring Tool

Below is a complete, self-contained monitoring dashboard. Save it as `cdn-monitor.html` and open it in any modern browser — no server or build step required. It simulates realistic probes from 15 global edge locations, visualizes latency/error rates on a world map, tracks historical trends, and generates CDN switching recommendations.

