# Bubble Shooter Game

Below is a complete, single-file HTML5 implementation. Save it as `bubble-shooter.html` and open it in any modern browser — no dependencies required.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>Bubble Shooter</title>
<style>
  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%;
