<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>Audio Segmentation Labeler</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f1220;
    --panel: #171a2e;
    --panel-2: #1f2340;
    --text: #e7e9f5;
    --muted: #9aa0c3;
    --accent: #6ea8ff;
    --accent-2: #8b5cf6;
    --danger: #ef4444;
    --ok: #22c55e;
    --border: #2a2f55;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  header {
    padding: 14px 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1f3d, #241a3d);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  header h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
  header .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-left: 10px; }
  main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .panel h2 {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .drop {
    border: 2px dashed var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .drop.hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: rgba(110,168,255,0.06); }
  .drop input { display: none; }
  .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  button, .btn {
    background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 13px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  button:hover:not(:disabled), .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  button.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #0b1020; border-color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  button.primary:hover { background: #88b8ff; color: #0b1020; }
  button.danger { color: var(--danger); }
  button.danger:hover { border-color: var(--danger); }
  input[type="text"], input[type="number"], select {
    background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 6px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
  }
  input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .wave-wrap {
    position: relative;
    background: #0b0e1c;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  canvas#wave { width: 100%; height: 160px; display: block; cursor: crosshair; }
  .playhead {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: #fff;
    pointer-events: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    left: 0;
  }
  .time-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .controls { margin-top: 10px; }
  .label-list {
    max-height: 520px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .label-item {
    background: var(--panel-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .label-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .label-item.active { background: #2a2f55; }
  .label-item .head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .label-item .name { font-weight: 600; }
  .label-item .time {
    font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .label-item .actions { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .label-item .actions button { padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
  .empty { color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 13px; }
  .kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .status { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .status.ok { color: var(--ok); }
  .status.err { color: var(--danger); }
  .seg-inputs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .seg-inputs label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .color-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div>
    <h1>🎧 Audio Segmentation Labeler</h1>
    <span class="sub">Upload · Annotate · Export</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="status" id="status">Ready</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- LEFT: player + waveform -->
  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Audio</h2>

    <label class="drop" id="drop">
      <input type="file" id="file" accept="audio/*" />
      <div><strong>Click or drop an audio file here</strong></div>
      <div class="hint">Supports MP3, WAV, OGG, FLAC, M4A</div>
    </label>

    <div class="wave-wrap" id="waveWrap" style="display:none;">
      <canvas id="wave"></canvas>
      <div class="playhead" id="playhead"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="time-bar" id="timeBar" style="display:none;">
      <span id="curTime">00:00.000</span>
      <span id="fileName">—</span>
      <span id="durTime">00:00.000</span>
    </div>

    <div class="controls row" id="controls" style="display:none;">
      <button id="playBtn" class="primary">▶ Play</button>
      <button id="backBtn">⏪ -5s</button>
      <button id="fwdBtn">⏩ +5s</button>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <label style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);">Speed
        <select id="speed">
          <option>0.5</option><option>0.75</option>
          <option selected>1</option>
          <option>1.25</option><option>1.5</option><option>2</option>
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <h2>New Segment</h2>
      <div class="seg-inputs">
        <div>
          <label>Start (s) <span class="kbd">I</span></label>
          <input type="number" id="segStart" step="0.001" min="0" value="0" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label>End (s) <span class="kbd">O</span></label>
          <input type="number" id="segEnd" step="0.001" min="0" value="0" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px;">
        <input type="text" id="segLabel" placeholder="Label name (e.g. speech, music)" style="flex:1;" />
        <input type="color" id="segColor" value="#6ea8ff" title="Segment color" />
        <button id="useCurBtn" title="Use current playback time as both start and end marker">Mark at playhead</button>
        <button id="addBtn" class="primary">+ Add <span class="kbd">L</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">Tip: press <span class="kbd">I</span> at segment start, <span class="kbd">O</span> at end, then <span class="kbd">L</span> to add.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RIGHT: label list + export -->
  <aside class="panel">
    <h2>Labels (<span id="count">0</span>)</h2>
    <div class="label-list" id="labelList">
      <div class="empty">No labels yet. Add your first segment on the left.</div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:14px;">
      <h2>Data</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <button id="exportJson">⬇ Export JSON</button>
        <button id="exportCsv">⬇ Export CSV</button>
        <button id="importBtn">⬆ Import JSON</button>
        <input type="file" id="importFile" accept="application/json" style="display:none;" />
        <button id="clearBtn" class="danger">🗑 Clear All</button>
      </div>
      <div class="hint" style="margin-top:8px;">
        JSON schema: <code>{ audio, duration, labels: [{id,name,start,end,color}] }</code>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:14px;">
      <h2>Shortcuts</h2>
      <div class="hint">
        <span class="kbd">Space</span> Play / Pause &nbsp;
        <span class="kbd">I</span> Set start &nbsp;
        <span class="kbd">O</span> Set end &nbsp;
        <span class="kbd">L</span> Add label &nbsp;
        <span class="kbd">←/→</span> ±1s
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</main>

<audio id="audio" preload="auto"></audio>

<script>
/* =========================================================
   Audio Segmentation Labeler
   Single-file vanilla JS implementation.
   ========================================================= */

const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
const audio     = $('audio');
const fileInput = $('file');
const drop      = $('drop');
const waveWrap  = $('waveWrap');
const canvas    = $('wave');
const ctx       = canvas.getContext('2d');
const playhead  = $('playhead');
const timeBar   = $('timeBar');
const controls  = $('controls');
const curTimeEl = $('curTime');
const durTimeEl = $('durTime');
const fileNameEl= $('fileName');
const playBtn   = $('playBtn');
const backBtn   = $('backBtn');
const fwdBtn    = $('fwdBtn');
const speedSel  = $('speed');
const segStart  = $('segStart');
const segEnd    = $('segEnd');
const segLabel  = $('segLabel');
const segColor  = $('segColor');
const addBtn    = $('addBtn');
const useCurBtn = $('useCurBtn');
const labelList = $('labelList');
const countEl   = $('count');
const statusEl  = $('status');

let peaks = [];          // downsampled waveform peaks
let duration = 0;        // seconds
let labels = [];         // {id,name,start,end,color}
let activeLabelId = null;
let audioFileName = '';

/* ---------- Utilities ---------- */
function fmtTime(s) {
  if (!isFinite(s) || s < 0) s = 0;
  const m = Math.floor(s / 60);
  const sec = s - m * 60;
  return `${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}:${sec.toFixed(3).padStart(6,'0')}`;
}
function setStatus(msg, kind='') {
  statusEl.textContent = msg;
  statusEl.className = 'status ' + kind;
  if (kind) setTimeout(() => { statusEl.className='status'; statusEl.textContent='Ready'; }, 2500);
}
function uid() { return Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10); }

/* ---------- File loading ---------- */
drop.addEventListener('click', () => fileInput.click());
drop.addEventListener('dragover', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); drop.classList.add('hover'); });
drop.addEventListener('dragleave', () => drop.classList.remove('hover'));
drop.addEventListener('drop', (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  drop.classList.remove('hover');
  if (e.dataTransfer.files[0]) loadFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]);
});
fileInput.addEventListener('change', (e) => {
  if (e.target.files[0]) loadFile(e.target.files[0]);
});

async function loadFile(file) {
  if (!file.type.startsWith('audio/') && !/\.(mp3|wav|ogg|flac|m4a|aac)$/i.test(file.name)) {
    setStatus('Unsupported file type', 'err'); return;
  }
  audioFileName = file.name;
  fileNameEl.textContent = file.name;
  const url = URL.createObjectURL(file);
  audio.src = url;

  setStatus('Decoding waveform…');
  try {
    const buf = await file.arrayBuffer();
    const ac = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
    const decoded = await ac.decodeAudioData(buf.slice(0));
    duration = decoded.duration;
    peaks = extractPeaks(decoded, 2000);
    ac.close();
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err);
    setStatus('Failed to decode audio', 'err');
    return;
  }

  waveWrap.style.display = 'block';
  timeBar.style.display = 'flex';
  controls.style.display = 'flex';
  segEnd.max = segStart.max = duration;
  durTimeEl.textContent = fmtTime(duration);
  resizeCanvas();
  drawWaveform();
  setStatus('Audio loaded', 'ok');
}

/* ---------- Waveform processing ---------- */
function extractPeaks(buffer, targetSamples) {
  const ch = buffer.getChannelData(0);
  const len = ch.length;
  const samplesPerPeak = Math.max(1, Math.floor(len / targetSamples));
  const out = new Float32Array(Math.ceil(len / samplesPerPeak));
  for (let i = 0, p = 0; i < len; i += samplesPerPeak, p++) {
    let min = 1, max = -1;
    const end = Math.min(len, i + samplesPerPeak);
    for (let j = i; j < end; j++) {
      const v = ch[j];
      if (v < min) min = v;
      if (v > max) max = v;
    }
    out[p] = Math.max(Math.abs(min), Math.abs(max));
  }
  return out;
}

function resizeCanvas() {
  const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;
  const w = canvas.clientWidth;
  const h = canvas.clientHeight;
  canvas.width = w * dpr;
  canvas.height = h * dpr;
  ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
}
window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (peaks.length) { resizeCanvas(); drawWaveform(); } });

function drawWaveform() {
  const w = canvas.clientWidth;
  const h = canvas.clientHeight;
  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);

  // background
  ctx.fillStyle = '#0b0e1c';
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);

  // label overlays
  for (const lab of labels) {
    const x1 = (lab.start / duration) * w;
    const x2 = (lab.end   / duration) * w;
    ctx.fillStyle = hexToRgba(lab.color || '#6ea8ff', 0.22);
    ctx.fillRect(x1, 0, Math.max(1, x2 - x1), h);
    if (lab.id === activeLabelId) {
      ctx.strokeStyle = lab.color || '#6ea8ff';
      ctx.lineWidth = 2;
      ctx.strokeRect(x1 + 1, 1, Math.max(1, x2 - x1) - 2, h - 2);
    }
  }

  // center line
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#2a2f55';
  ctx.lineWidth = 1;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(0, h/2); ctx.lineTo(w, h/2); ctx.stroke();

  // peaks
  if (!peaks.length) return;
  const barW = w / peaks.length;
  ctx.fillStyle = '#6ea8ff';
  for (let i = 0; i < peaks.length; i++) {
    const amp = peaks[i] * (h / 2);
    const x = i * barW;
    ctx.fillRect(x, h/2 - amp, Math.max(1, barW - 0.5), amp * 2);
  }
}

function hexToRgba(hex, a) {
  const m = hex.replace('#','');
  const r = parseInt(m.substring(0,2),16);
  const g = parseInt(m.substring(2,4),16);
  const b = parseInt(m.substring(4,6),16);
  return `rgba(${r},${g},${b},${a})`;
}

/* ---------- Playback ---------- */
playBtn.addEventListener('click', togglePlay);
backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => { audio.currentTime = Math.max(0, audio.currentTime - 5); });
fwdBtn .addEventListener('click', () => { audio.currentTime = Math.min(duration, audio.currentTime + 5); });
speedSel.addEventListener('change', () => { audio.playbackRate = parseFloat(speedSel.value); });

function togglePlay() {
  if (!audio.src) return;
  if (audio.paused) { audio.play(); } else { audio.pause(); }
}
audio.addEventListener('play',  () => playBtn.textContent = '⏸ Pause');
audio.addEventListener('pause', () => playBtn.textContent = '▶ Play');
audio.addEventListener('ended', () => playBtn.textContent = '▶ Play');
audio.addEventListener('timeupdate', updatePlayhead);

function updatePlayhead() {
  const t = audio.currentTime;
  curTimeEl.textContent = fmtTime(t);
  const w = canvas.clientWidth;
  playhead.style.left = ((t / duration) * w) + 'px';
}

canvas.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  if (!duration) return;
  const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
  const x = e.clientX - rect.left;
  audio.currentTime = (x / rect.width) * duration;
});

/* ---------- Segment creation ---------- */
useCurBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
  const t = audio.currentTime || 0;
  segStart.value = t.toFixed(3);
  segEnd.value   = t.toFixed(3);
});
addBtn.addEventListener('click', addLabel);

function addLabel() {
  const start = parseFloat(segStart.value);
  const end   = parseFloat(segEnd.value);
  const name  = segLabel.value.trim() || 'untitled';
  const color = segColor.value;

  if (!duration) { setStatus('Load an audio file first', 'err'); return; }
  if (isNaN(start) || isNaN(end)) { setStatus('Invalid times', 'err'); return; }
  if (start < 0 || end > duration) { setStatus('Times out of range', 'err'); return; }
  if (start >= end) { setStatus('Start must be < End', 'err'); return; }

  labels.push({ id: uid(), name, start, end, color });
  labels.sort((a,b) => a.start - b.start);
  segLabel.value = '';
  renderLabels();
  drawWaveform();
  setStatus(`Added "${name}"`, 'ok');
}

/* ---------- Label list ---------- */
function renderLabels() {
  countEl.textContent = labels.length;
  if (!labels.length) {
    labelList.innerHTML = '<div class="empty">No labels yet. Add your first segment on the left.</div>';
    return;
  }
  labelList.innerHTML = '';
  labels.forEach((lab, idx) => {
    const el = document.createElement('div');
    el.className = 'label-item' + (lab.id === activeLabelId ? ' active' : '');
    el.style.borderLeftColor = lab.color;
    el.innerHTML = `
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <span class="color-dot" style="background:${lab.color}"></span>
          <span class="name">${escapeHtml(lab.name)}</span>
        </div>
        <span class="time">#${idx+1}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="time">${fmtTime(lab.start)} → ${fmtTime(lab.end)}  (${(lab.end-lab.start).toFixed(3)}s)</div>
      <div class="actions">
        <button data-act="goto">▶ Go to</button>
        <button data-act="play">▶ Play segment</button>
        <button data-act="edit">✎ Edit</button>
        <button data-act="del" class="danger">✕ Delete</button>
      </div>
    `;
    el.querySelector('[data-act="goto"]').onclick = (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      audio.currentTime = lab.start;
      activeLabelId = lab.id;
      renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
    };
    el.querySelector('[data-act="play"]').onclick = (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      audio.currentTime = lab.start;
      audio.play();
      const stopAt = lab.end;
      const onTime = () => {
        if (audio.currentTime >= stopAt) { audio.pause(); audio.removeEventListener('timeupdate', onTime); }
      };
      audio.addEventListener('timeupdate', onTime);
      activeLabelId = lab.id;
      renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
    };
    el.querySelector('[data-act="edit"]').onclick = (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      const newName = prompt('Label name:', lab.name);
      if (newName !== null) lab.name = newName.trim() || lab.name;
      const newStart = prompt('Start (seconds):', lab.start.toFixed(3));
      if (newStart !== null) { const v = parseFloat(newStart); if (!isNaN(v) && v >= 0 && v < lab.end) lab.start = v; }
      const newEnd = prompt('End (seconds):', lab.end.toFixed(3));
      if (newEnd !== null) { const v = parseFloat(newEnd); if (!isNaN(v) && v > lab.start && v <= duration) lab.end = v; }
      labels.sort((a,b) => a.start - b.start);
      renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
    };
    el.querySelector('[data-act="del"]').onclick = (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      if (confirm(`Delete label "${lab.name}"?`)) {
        labels = labels.filter(l => l.id !== lab.id);
        if (activeLabelId === lab.id) activeLabelId = null;
        renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
      }
    };
    el.onclick = () => {
      activeLabelId = lab.id;
      segStart.value = lab.start.toFixed(3);
      segEnd.value   = lab.end.toFixed(3);
      segLabel.value = lab.name;
      segColor.value = lab.color;
      renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
    };
    labelList.appendChild(el);
  });
}

function escapeHtml(s) {
  return s.replace(/[&<>"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
}

/* ---------- Export / Import ---------- */
$('exportJson').onclick = () => {
  const data = {
    audio: audioFileName,
    duration,
    exportedAt: new Date().toISOString(),
    labels: labels.map(l => ({ id:l.id, name:l.name, start:+l.start.toFixed(3), end:+l.end.toFixed(3), color:l.color }))
  };
  download(JSON.stringify(data, null, 2), (audioFileName || 'labels') + '.json', 'application/json');
  setStatus('Exported JSON', 'ok');
};

$('exportCsv').onclick = () => {
  const rows = [['id','name','start_sec','end_sec','duration_sec','color']];
  labels.forEach(l => rows.push([l.id, csvEscape(l.name), l.start.toFixed(3), l.end.toFixed(3), (l.end-l.start).toFixed(3), l.color]));
  const csv = rows.map(r => r.join(',')).join('\n');
  download(csv, (audioFileName || 'labels') + '.csv', 'text/csv');
  setStatus('Exported CSV', 'ok');
};
function csvEscape(v) {
  v = String(v);
  if (/[",\n]/.test(v)) return '"' + v.replace(/"/g,'""') + '"';
  return v;
}

function download(content, filename, mime) {
  const blob = new Blob([content], { type: mime });
  const a = document.createElement('a');
  a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
  a.download = filename;
  document.body.appendChild(a); a.click();
  setTimeout(() => { URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href); a.remove(); }, 0);
}

$('importBtn').onclick = () => $('importFile').click();
$('importFile').addEventListener('change', async (e) => {
  const f = e.target.files[0]; if (!f) return;
  try {
    const data = JSON.parse(await f.text());
    if (!Array.isArray(data.labels)) throw new Error('Invalid JSON');
    labels = data.labels.map(l => ({
      id: l.id || uid(),
      name: String(l.name || 'untitled'),
      start: parseFloat(l.start),
      end:   parseFloat(l.end),
      color: l.color || '#6ea8ff'
    })).filter(l => !isNaN(l.start) && !isNaN(l.end) && l.end > l.start);
    labels.sort((a,b) => a.start - b.start);
    renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
    setStatus(`Imported ${labels.length} labels`, 'ok');
  } catch (err) {
    setStatus('Import failed: ' + err.message, 'err');
  }
  e.target.value = '';
});

$('clearBtn').onclick = () => {
  if (!labels.length) return;
  if (confirm('Delete ALL labels?')) {
    labels = []; activeLabelId = null;
    renderLabels(); drawWaveform();
  }
};

/* ---------- Keyboard shortcuts ---------- */
document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
  const tag = (e.target.tagName || '').toLowerCase();
  if (tag === 'input' || tag === 'textarea' || tag === 'select') return;
  if (e.code === 'Space')      { e.preventDefault(); togglePlay(); }
  else if (e.key === 'i' || e.key === 'I') { segStart.value = (audio.currentTime || 0).toFixed(3); }
  else if (e.key === 'o' || e.key === 'O') { segEnd.value   = (audio.currentTime || 0).toFixed(3); }
  else if (e.key === 'l' || e.key === 'L') { addLabel(); }
  else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft')  { audio.currentTime = Math.max(0, audio.currentTime - 1); }
  else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') { audio.currentTime = Math.min(duration, audio.currentTime + 1); }
});

/* ---------- Init ---------- */
renderLabels();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

## How to Use

1. **Save** the code above as `audio-labeler.html`.
2. **Open** it in a modern browser (double-click the file).
3. **Upload** an audio file by clicking the drop zone or dragging a file onto it.
4. **Play** the audio and press `I` where a segment starts, `O` where it ends.
5. Type a label name, pick a color, and press `L` (or click **+ Add**).
6. Click any label in the right panel to jump to it, play just that segment, edit, or delete.
7. **Export** your annotations as JSON (for re-import / programmatic use) or CSV (for spreadsheets / ML pipelines).

## Exported JSON Schema

```json
{
  "audio": "interview.wav",
  "duration": 182.43,
  "exportedAt": "2025-01-15T10:22:04.123Z",
  "labels": [
    { "id": "a1b2c3d4", "name": "speech",  "start": 0.000,  "end": 12.450, "color": "#6ea8ff" },
    { "id": "e5f6g7h8", "name": "music",   "start": 12.450, "end": 25.800, "color": "#8b5cf6" }
  ]
}
```

## Implementation Notes

- **Waveform rendering** uses `AudioContext.decodeAudioData` to extract peaks from channel 0, downsampled to ~2000 points for smooth performance even on long files.
- **Playback** uses the native `<audio>` element (broad codec support, reliable seeking), while the Web Audio API is used only for analysis.
- **Segment overlays** are drawn directly on the canvas with the label's color at 22% opacity; the active label gets a stroked border.
- **No external dependencies** — pure HTML/CSS/JS, fully offline-capable once loaded.
- **Privacy**: all processing happens locally in the browser; no audio is uploaded anywhere.

