}

// ============================================================
// INITIALIZATION
// ============================================================
function init() {
  loadDemo();
  updateTimeline();
  updateTimeDisplay();
  renderFrame(0);
}

// Polyfill for roundRect if needed
if (!CanvasRenderingContext2D.prototype.roundRect) {
  CanvasRenderingContext2D.prototype.roundRect = function(x, y, w, h, r) {
    if (typeof r === 'number') r = [r, r, r, r];
    this.moveTo(x + r[0], y);
    this.lineTo(x + w - r[1], y);
    this.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y, x + w, y + r[1]);
    this.lineTo(x + w, y + h - r[2]);
    this.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y + h, x + w - r[2], y + h);
    this.lineTo(x + r[3], y + h);
    this.quadraticCurveTo(x, y + h, x, y + h - r[3]);
    this.lineTo(x, y + r[0]);
    this.quadraticCurveTo(x, y, x + r[0], y);
    this.closePath();
  };
}

init();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Features Overview

### 🎨 Shape Tools
| Shape | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| Rectangle | Rounded rectangle with customizable fill/stroke |
| Circle | Ellipse shape |
| Triangle | Equilateral triangle |
| Star | 5-pointed star |
| Line | Horizontal line |
| Arrow | Line with arrowhead |
| Heart | Bezier heart shape |
| Diamond | Rotated square |
| Text | Custom text with font size control |

### 🎭 Animation Effects (14 types)
- **Fade In/Out** — Opacity transitions
- **Slide** (Left/Right/Up/Down) — Position transitions from off-screen
- **Scale In/Out** — Size transitions
- **Rotate/Spin** — Rotation animations (360°/720°)
- **Bounce** — Physics-based bounce easing
- **Shake** — Vibrating effect
- **Pulse** — Rhythmic scaling
- **Swing** — Pendulum-like rotation

### ⚙️ Animation Controls
- **Delay** — When the animation starts (seconds)
- **Duration** — How long the animation lasts
- **Easing** — 6 easing functions (linear, easeIn, easeOut, easeInOut, bounce, elastic)
- **Custom Path** — Draw freehand animation paths with the Path tool
- **Multiple effects** can stack on a single shape

### 🎬 Timeline
- Visual track bars for each shape (draggable to adjust timing)
- Ruler with time markers
- Playhead indicator
- Zoom control
- Click-to-seek

### 📹 Video Export
- **Formats**: WebM (VP8) or MP4 (browser-dependent)
- **Quality**: Low/Medium/High bitrate options
- **Resolution**: Original, HD (720p), or Full HD (1080p)
- Real-time progress bar during export

### ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `Space` | Play/Pause |
| `Delete` | Delete selected shape |
| `Ctrl+D` | Duplicate shape |
| `Ctrl+Z` | Undo |
| `Ctrl+Shift+Z` | Redo |
| `V` | Select tool |
| `P` | Path drawing tool |

