## Features Summary

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **URL Input** | Smart URL normalization (auto-adds `https://`) |
| **Device Presets** | Desktop (1920×1080), Tablet (768×1024), Mobile (375×812) |
| **Custom Viewport** | Set any width × height from 320px to 3840px |
| **Full Page Capture** | Toggle to capture the entire scrollable page |
| **Retina Quality** | 2× device scale factor for crisp screenshots |
| **Thumbnail** | Auto-generated viewport-sized thumbnail |
| **Download** | One-click download for both full and thumbnail images |
| **Browser Frame** | Screenshot displayed in a macOS-style browser frame |
| **History** | Last 12 captures saved in localStorage |
| **Error Handling** | Friendly messages for DNS, timeout, SSL errors |
| **Resource Blocking** | Blocks fonts/media for faster page loads |
| **Auto Cleanup** | Screenshots auto-delete after 1 hour |
| **Responsive UI** | Fully responsive dark-themed interface |
| **Graceful Shutdown** | Properly closes browser on SIGINT/SIGTERM |

# Software Development Documentation Management System

Below is a complete, runnable full-stack documentation management system built with **Node.js + Express + SQLite** (backend) and a **single-page HTML/JS frontend** with live Markdown editing. It covers all requested features: Markdown editing, auto-generated API docs, versioning with change history, and admin-level project/team management.

