## 12. Feature Summary

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Markdown editing** | Split-pane editor with live preview via `marked.js` |
| **Auto API doc generation** | `/api/documents/generate-api` parses YAML/JSON spec → Markdown |
| **Version management** | Every save creates a new version in `document_versions`; full history visible in sidebar |
| **Change history** | Each version stores `change_note`, author, timestamp |
| **Version restore** | One-click restore creates a new version from any historical snapshot |
| **Project access control** | Roles: `viewer` / `editor` / `owner` per project; admins bypass |
| **Team management** | Admin panel to promote/demote/delete users; project owners add/remove members |
| **Document types** | `spec`, `api`, `design` with color-coded tags |
| **Auth** | JWT + bcrypt; 7-day tokens persisted in `localStorage` |

## 13. Quick Start

```bash
mkdir doc-manager && cd doc-manager
