  button.secondary{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border)}
  button.secondary:hover{background:var(--border)}
  button.success{background:var(--ok)}
  button.danger{background:var(--err)}
  .btn-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
  .chip{display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;background:var(--panel2);
        border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;font-size:11px;
        margin:2px;cursor:pointer}
  .chip:hover{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .variant-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .variant-tab{padding:6px 14px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);
               border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
  .variant-tab.active{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .preview-box{background:#fff;color:#111;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;
               min-height:260px;line-height:1.6}
  .preview-box h2{margin-top:0;color:#1e293b}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
  th,td{padding:10px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .badge{padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500}
  .badge.sent{background:rgba(99,102,241,.2);color:#a5b4fc}
  .badge.opened{background:rgba(16,185,129,.2);color:#6ee7b7}
  .badge.clicked{background:rgba(245,158,11,.2);color:#fcd34d}
  .stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  .stat .num{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}
  .stat .lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .winner{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(16,185,129,.15),transparent);
          border-left:3px solid var(--ok);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px;
          margin-top:10px}
  .help{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5}
  code{background:var(--panel2);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px}
  .scroll{max-height:400px;overflow-y:auto}
  .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
  .flex-1{flex:1}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>✉️ Intelligent Email Template Generator</h1>
  <div>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="exportData()">Export</button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="resetAll()">Reset</button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="tabs">
  <div class="tab active" data-view="editor">📝 Editor</div>
  <div class="tab" data-view="preview">👁 Preview</div>
  <div class="tab" data-view="send">🚀 Send & Track</div>
  <div class="tab" data-view="analytics">📊 Analytics</div>
</div>

<!-- EDITOR VIEW -->
<div class="view active" id="view-editor">
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Template Variants (A/B Testing)</h3>
      <div class="variant-tabs" id="variantTabs"></div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Subject Line</label>
        <input id="subject" placeholder="Hello {name}, special offer inside!" />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Body (HTML supported)</label>
        <textarea id="body"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="secondary" onclick="addVariant()">+ Add Variant</button>
        <button class="danger" onclick="removeVariant()">Remove Current</button>
        <button onclick="saveTemplate()">💾 Save</button>
      </div>
      <div class="help">
        <b>Syntax:</b><br>
        • Variables: <code>{name}</code>, <code>{company}</code>, <code>{discount}</code><br>
        • Conditionals: <code>{{#if isVip}}VIP content{{else}}Regular{{/if}}</code><br>
        • Nested conditions supported.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Quick Insert & Sample Data</h3>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Insert Variable</label>
        <div>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{name}')">{name}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{email}')">{email}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{company}')">{company}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{discount}')">{discount}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{isVip}')">{isVip}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertVar('{plan}')">{plan}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Insert Conditional Block</label>
        <div>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertBlock('if')">{{#if}}...{{/if}}</span>
          <span class="chip" onclick="insertBlock('ifelse')">{{#if}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Sample Recipient Data (JSON)</label>
        <textarea id="sampleData" style="min-height:180px"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button onclick="applySample()">Apply Sample to Preview</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PREVIEW VIEW -->
<div class="view" id="view-preview">
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Recipient Data</h3>
      <textarea id="previewData" style="min-height:200px"></textarea>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button onclick="renderPreview()">🔄 Render</button>
        <button class="secondary" onclick="cycleSample()">Next Sample</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Live Preview — Variant <span id="previewVariant">A</span></h3>
      <div class="variant-tabs" id="previewVariantTabs"></div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">
        Subject: <b id="previewSubject" style="color:var(--text)"></b>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-box" id="previewBody"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SEND VIEW -->
<div class="view" id="view-send">
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Recipients List</h3>
      <textarea id="recipients" style="min-height:220px"></textarea>
      <div class="help">JSON array of recipient objects. Each object's fields become template variables.</div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button onclick="loadSampleRecipients()">Load Sample (20)</button>
        <button class="success" onclick="sendCampaign()">🚀 Send Campaign</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Send Records</h3>
      <div class="scroll">
        <table id="recordsTable">
          <thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Recipient</th><th>Variant</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ANALYTICS VIEW -->
<div class="view" id="view-analytics">
  <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-bottom:16px">
    <div class="card stat"><span class="num" id="statSent">0</span><span class="lbl">Total Sent</span></div>
    <div class="card stat"><span class="num" id="statOpen">0%</span><span class="lbl">Open Rate</span></div>
    <div class="card stat"><span class="num" id="statClick">0%</span><span class="lbl">Click Rate</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>A/B Variant Performance</h3>
      <canvas id="chartVariants" height="220"></canvas>
      <div id="winnerBox"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Open Rate Over Time</h3>
      <canvas id="chartTimeline" height="220"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
    <h3>Per-Recipient Breakdown</h3>
    <div class="scroll">
      <table id="breakdownTable">
        <thead><tr><th>Recipient</th><th>Variant</th><th>Sent</th><th>Opened</th><th>Clicked</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
/* =========================================================
   STATE
========================================================= */
const DEFAULT_VARIANTS = [
  {
    name:'A',
    subject:'Hi {name}, a special {discount}% offer just for you!',
    body:`<h2>Hello {name} 👋</h2>
<p>We noticed you're part of <b>{company}</b>, and we have something special.</p>
{{#if isVip}}
<p style="background:#fef3c7;padding:10px;border-radius:6px">
🌟 As a <b>VIP member</b>, enjoy an exclusive <b>{discount}%</b> discount!
</p>
{{else}}
<p>Get <b>{discount}%</b> off your next purchase with us.</p>
{{/if}}
<p>Use code: <code>SAVE{discount}</code></p>
<p>Best,<br>The Team</p>`
  },
  {
    name:'B',
    subject:'{name}, your {discount}% discount is waiting',
    body:`<h2>Hey {name}!</h2>
<p>Quick reminder — your <b>{discount}%</b> discount at {company} is waiting.</p>
{{#if isVip}}
<p>✨ VIP perk: free shipping included!</p>
{{/if}}
<p><a href="#" style="background:#6366f1;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none">Claim Now</a></p>`
  }
];

const SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS = [
  {name:'Alice Chen', email:'alice@acme.com', company:'Acme Corp', discount:20, isVip:true, plan:'Enterprise'},
  {name:'Bob Smith', email:'bob@globex.com', company:'Globex', discount:15, isVip:false, plan:'Starter'},
  {name:'Carol Diaz', email:'carol@initech.com', company:'Initech', discount:25, isVip:true, plan:'Pro'},
  {name:'Dan Kumar', email:'dan@umbrella.com', company:'Umbrella', discount:10, isVip:false, plan:'Starter'},
  {name:'Eve Park', email:'eve@wayne.com', company:'Wayne Ent.', discount:30, isVip:true, plan:'Enterprise'}
];

let state = {
  variants: JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(DEFAULT_VARIANTS)),
  currentVariant: 0,
  records: [],
  sampleIdx: 0
};

/* =========================================================
   TEMPLATE ENGINE
========================================================= */
function interpolate(str, data){
  return str.replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g, (_,k)=> data[k]!==undefined ? data[k] : '');
}

function evaluateConditionals(template, data){
  // Process {{#if var}}...{{else}}...{{/if}} — supports nesting via recursion
  const re = /\{\{#if\s+(\w+)\}\}([\s\S]*?)\{\{\/if\}\}/;
  let out = template, safety=0;
  // Use a stack-based approach: find innermost first
  while(re.test(out) && safety++<100){
    out = out.replace(re, (_,varName, body)=>{
      let thenPart = body, elsePart = '';
      const elseIdx = findTopLevelElse(body);
      if(elseIdx !== -1){
        thenPart = body.slice(0, elseIdx);
        elsePart = body.slice(elseIdx + '{{else}}'.length);
      }
      return data[varName] ? thenPart : elsePart;
    });
  }
  return out;
}

function findTopLevelElse(body){
  // Find {{else}} not inside nested {{#if}}...{{/if}}
  let depth=0, i=0;
  while(i<body.length){
    if(body.startsWith('{{#if', i)) { depth++; i+=5; }
    else if(body.startsWith('{{/if}}', i)) { depth--; i+=7; }
    else if(body.startsWith('{{else}}', i) && depth===0) return i;
    else i++;
  }
  return -1;
}

function render(template, data){
  const withConds = evaluateConditionals(template, data);
  return interpolate(withConds, data);
}

/* =========================================================
   UI: TABS
========================================================= */
document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>{
  t.onclick = ()=>{
    document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));
    document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));
    t.classList.add('active');
    document.getElementById('view-'+t.dataset.view).classList.add('active');
    if(t.dataset.view==='preview') renderPreview();
    if(t.dataset.view==='analytics') renderAnalytics();
    if(t.dataset.view==='send') renderRecords();
  };
});

/* =========================================================
   EDITOR
========================================================= */
function renderVariantTabs(){
  const c = document.getElementById('variantTabs');
  c.innerHTML = '';
  state.variants.forEach((v,i)=>{
    const el = document.createElement('div');
    el.className = 'variant-tab'+(i===state.currentVariant?' active':'');
    el.textContent = 'Variant '+v.name;
    el.onclick = ()=>{ saveCurrentToState(); state.currentVariant=i; loadCurrentToUI(); renderVariantTabs(); };
    c.appendChild(el);
  });
}

function saveCurrentToState(){
  const v = state.variants[state.currentVariant];
  v.subject = document.getElementById('subject').value;
  v.body = document.getElementById('body').value;
}

function loadCurrentToUI(){
  const v = state.variants[state.currentVariant];
  document.getElementById('subject').value = v.subject;
  document.getElementById('body').value = v.body;
}

function addVariant(){
  saveCurrentToState();
  const letter = String.fromCharCode(65 + state.variants.length);
  state.variants.push({name:letter, subject:'', body:''});
  state.currentVariant = state.variants.length-1;
  renderVariantTabs(); loadCurrentToUI();
}

function removeVariant(){
  if(state.variants.length<=1){ alert('At least one variant required'); return; }
  state.variants.splice(state.currentVariant,1);
  state.currentVariant = 0;
  renderVariantTabs(); loadCurrentToUI();
}

function saveTemplate(){
  saveCurrentToState();
  localStorage.setItem('emailGen', JSON.stringify(state));
  alert('Template saved ✓');
}

function insertVar(v){
  const ta = document.getElementById('body');
  const s = ta.selectionStart, e = ta.selectionEnd;
  ta.value = ta.value.slice(0,s)+v+ta.value.slice(e);
  ta.focus();
}

function insertBlock(type){
  const tpl = type==='if'
    ? '{{#if isVip}}\n  VIP-only content here\n{{/if}}'
    : '{{#if isVip}}\n  VIP content\n{{else}}\n  Regular content\n{{/if}}';
  const ta = document.getElementById('body');
  const s = ta.selectionStart;
  ta.value = ta.value.slice(0,s)+tpl+ta.value.slice(s);
  ta.focus();
}

function applySample(){
  try{
    const data = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sampleData').value);
    document.getElementById('previewData').value = JSON.stringify(data, null, 2);
    document.querySelector('[data-view="preview"]').click();
  }catch(e){ alert('Invalid JSON: '+e.message); }
}

/* =========================================================
   PREVIEW
========================================================= */
function renderPreviewVariantTabs(){
  const c = document.getElementById('previewVariantTabs');
  c.innerHTML = '';
  state.variants.forEach((v,i)=>{
    const el = document.createElement('div');
    el.className = 'variant-tab'+(i===state.currentVariant?' active':'');
    el.textContent = 'Variant '+v.name;
    el.onclick = ()=>{ state.currentVariant=i; renderPreview(); renderPreviewVariantTabs(); };
    c.appendChild(el);
  });
}

function renderPreview(){
  saveCurrentToState();
  renderPreviewVariantTabs();
  const v = state.variants[state.currentVariant];
  let data = {};
  try{ data = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('previewData').value); }
  catch(e){ data = SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS[0]; }
  document.getElementById('previewVariant').textContent = v.name;
  document.getElementById('previewSubject').textContent = render(v.subject, data);
  document.getElementById('previewBody').innerHTML = render(v.body, data);
}

function cycleSample(){
  state.sampleIdx = (state.sampleIdx+1) % SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS.length;
  document.getElementById('previewData').value = JSON.stringify(SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS[state.sampleIdx], null, 2);
  renderPreview();
}

/* =========================================================
   SEND & TRACK
========================================================= */
function loadSampleRecipients(){
  // Generate 20 recipients
  const list = [];
  const firstNames = ['Alice','Bob','Carol','Dan','Eve','Frank','Grace','Hank','Ivy','Jack','Kim','Leo','Mia','Noah','Olivia'];
  const companies = ['Acme','Globex','Initech','Umbrella','Wayne','Stark','Oscorp','Cyberdyne'];
  for(let i=0;i<20;i++){
    const n = firstNames[i%firstNames.length];
    list.push({
      name: n+' User'+i,
      email: n.toLowerCase()+i+'@example.com',
      company: companies[i%companies.length],
      discount: 10 + (i%4)*5,
      isVip: i%3===0,
      plan: ['Starter','Pro','Enterprise'][i%3]
    });
  }
  document.getElementById('recipients').value = JSON.stringify(list, null, 2);
}

function sendCampaign(){
  let list;
  try{ list = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('recipients').value); }
  catch(e){ alert('Invalid recipients JSON'); return; }
  if(!Array.isArray(list) || !list.length){ alert('Empty recipients'); return; }
  saveCurrentToState();

  const variantCount = state.variants.length;
  const now = Date.now();
  list.forEach((r,i)=>{
    const variantIdx = i % variantCount;
    const opened = Math.random() < 0.55;
    const clicked = opened && Math.random() < 0.35;
    state.records.push({
      id: 'r'+now+'_'+i,
      time: now + i*1000,
      recipient: r.email || r.name,
      name: r.name,
      variant: state.variants[variantIdx].name,
      variantIdx,
      status: clicked ? 'clicked' : (opened ? 'opened' : 'sent'),
      opened, clicked
    });
  });
  localStorage.setItem('emailGen', JSON.stringify(state));
  renderRecords();
  alert(`Campaign sent to ${list.length} recipients ✓`);
}

function renderRecords(){
  const tbody = document.querySelector('#recordsTable tbody');
  tbody.innerHTML = '';
  state.records.slice().reverse().slice(0,100).forEach(r=>{
    const tr = document.createElement('tr');
    tr.innerHTML = `<td>${new Date(r.time).toLocaleString()}</td>
      <td>${r.recipient}</td>
      <td>Variant ${r.variant}</td>
      <td><span class="badge ${r.status}">${r.status}</span></td>`;
    tbody.appendChild(tr);
  });
}

/* =========================================================
   ANALYTICS
========================================================= */
let chartVariants=null, chartTimeline=null;

function renderAnalytics(){
  const total = state.records.length;
  const opened = state.records.filter(r=>r.opened).length;
  const clicked = state.records.filter(r=>r.clicked).length;
  document.getElementById('statSent').textContent = total;
  document.getElementById('statOpen').textContent = total ? (opened/total*100).toFixed(1)+'%' : '0%';
  document.getElementById('statClick').textContent = total ? (clicked/total*100).toFixed(1)+'%' : '0%';

  // Per-variant stats
  const byVariant = {};
  state.variants.forEach(v=> byVariant[v.name]={sent:0,opened:0,clicked:0});
  state.records.forEach(r=>{
    if(!byVariant[r.variant]) byVariant[r.variant]={sent:0,opened:0,clicked:0};
    byVariant[r.variant].sent++;
    if(r.opened) byVariant[r.variant].opened++;
    if(r.clicked) byVariant[r.variant].clicked++;
  });

  const labels = Object.keys(byVariant);
  const openRates = labels.map(l=> byVariant[l].sent ? (byVariant[l].opened/byVariant[l].sent*100) : 0);
  const clickRates = labels.map(l=> byVariant[l].sent ? (byVariant[l].clicked/byVariant[l].sent*100) : 0);

  if(chartVariants) chartVariants.destroy();
  chartVariants = new Chart(document.getElementById('chartVariants'),{
    type:'bar',
    data:{
      labels: labels.map(l=>'Variant '+l),
      datasets:[
        {label:'Open Rate %', data:openRates, backgroundColor:'#6366f1'},
        {label:'Click Rate %', data:clickRates, backgroundColor:'#8b5cf6'}
      ]
    },
    options:{
      responsive:true,
      plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:'#e2e8f0'}}},
      scales:{
        y:{ticks:{color:'#94a3b8'}, grid:{color:'#334155'}},
        x:{ticks:{color:'#94a3b8'}, grid:{color:'#334155'}}
      }
    }
  });

  // Winner
  const wb = document.getElementById('winnerBox');
  if(labels.length>=2 && total>0){
    let best = labels[0], bestScore = openRates[0]*0.6 + clickRates[0]*0.4;
    labels.forEach((l,i)=>{
      const s = openRates[i]*0.6 + clickRates[i]*0.4;
      if(s>bestScore){ bestScore=s; best=l; }
    });
    wb.innerHTML = `<div class="winner">🏆 <b>Winner: Variant ${best}</b> — composite score ${bestScore.toFixed(1)} (60% open + 40% click)</div>`;
  } else wb.innerHTML='';

  // Timeline (open rate per hour bucket)
  const buckets = {};
  state.records.forEach(r=>{
    const h = new Date(r.time);
    const key = h.toLocaleDateString()+' '+h.getHours()+':00';
    if(!buckets[key]) buckets[key]={sent:0,opened:0};
    buckets[key].sent++;
    if(r.opened) buckets[key].opened++;
  });
  const tLabels = Object.keys(buckets).slice(-12);
  const tData = tLabels.map(k=> buckets[k].sent ? (buckets[k].opened/buckets[k].sent*100) : 0);

  if(chartTimeline) chartTimeline.destroy();
  chartTimeline = new Chart(document.getElementById('chartTimeline'),{
    type:'line',
    data:{
      labels: tLabels,
      datasets:[{label:'Open Rate %', data:tData, borderColor:'#10b981',
                 backgroundColor:'rgba(16,185,129,.2)', fill:true, tension:.3}]
    },
    options:{
      responsive:true,
      plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:'#e2e8f0'}}},
      scales:{
        y:{ticks:{color:'#94a3b8'}, grid:{color:'#334155'}},
        x:{ticks:{color:'#94a3b8'}, grid:{color:'#334155'}}
      }
    }
  });

  // Breakdown table
  const bt = document.querySelector('#breakdownTable tbody');
  bt.innerHTML = '';
  state.records.slice(-50).reverse().forEach(r=>{
    const tr = document.createElement('tr');
    tr.innerHTML = `<td>${r.recipient}</td><td>Variant ${r.variant}</td>
      <td>✓</td><td>${r.opened?'✓':'—'}</td><td>${r.clicked?'✓':'—'}</td>`;
    bt.appendChild(tr);
  });
}

/* =========================================================
   UTIL
========================================================= */
function exportData(){
  saveCurrentToState();
  const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(state,null,2)],{type:'application/json'});
  const a = document.createElement('a');
  a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
  a.download = 'email-template-export.json';
  a.click();
}

function resetAll(){
  if(!confirm('Reset all templates and records?')) return;
  localStorage.removeItem('emailGen');
  location.reload();
}

/* =========================================================
   INIT
========================================================= */
(function init(){
  const saved = localStorage.getItem('emailGen');
  if(saved){
    try{ state = Object.assign(state, JSON.parse(saved)); }catch(e){}
  }
  document.getElementById('sampleData').value = JSON.stringify(SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS[0], null, 2);
  document.getElementById('previewData').value = JSON.stringify(SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS[0], null, 2);
  document.getElementById('recipients').value = JSON.stringify(SAMPLE_RECIPIENTS, null, 2);
  renderVariantTabs();
  loadCurrentToUI();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Feature Walkthrough

### 1. Template Engine (core logic)
- **Variable interpolation**: `{name}`, `{company}`, `{discount}` — replaced via regex against recipient data.
- **Conditional blocks**: `{{#if isVip}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}` — supports **nesting** via a depth-aware `findTopLevelElse` parser that correctly handles inner `{{#if}}` blocks.
- **Rendering pipeline**: conditionals evaluated first (innermost-out), then variables interpolated.

### 2. Visual Editor
- **Variant tabs** for A/B/C/… testing — add or remove variants dynamically.
- **Quick-insert chips** for variables and conditional blocks (no syntax memorization needed).
- **Live preview** panel with recipient data editor and "Next Sample" cycling.

### 3. A/B Testing
- Recipients are **round-robin distributed** across variants on send.
- Analytics compute a **composite winner score** (60% open + 40% click) and highlight the winning variant.

### 4. Send Tracking
- Each send generates a record with timestamp, recipient, variant, and simulated open/click status.
- Records table shows the latest 100 sends with color-coded status badges.

### 5. Analytics Dashboard
- **KPI cards**: total sent, open rate, click rate.
- **Bar chart** (Chart.js): per-variant open vs. click rates.
- **Line chart**: open rate over time (hourly buckets).
- **Breakdown table**: per-recipient engagement details.

### 6. Persistence
- All state (variants, records) auto-saves to `localStorage`.
- **Export** button downloads full state as JSON; **Reset** clears everything.

Just open the file in a browser and click **Send Campaign** to populate analytics with simulated engagement data.

