As a code expert, I have designed a robust, production-ready chunk upload solution. This implementation includes **file hashing (for unique identification and future resume/quick-upload capabilities)**, **concurrent chunk uploading**, and **stream-based merging** to prevent memory overflow on the server.

Below is the complete guide to initializing the project, along with the executable backend and frontend code.

### 1. Project Initialization

Open your terminal and run the following commands to set up the project structure and install dependencies:

```bash
