## ✨ Panel Features

| Section | Details |
|---|---|
| **Header** | Animated avatar with rotating ring, golden name with shimmer effect, bloodline badge, and classification tags |
| **Basic Info** | 8-field grid covering name, gender, age, race, birthplace, affiliation, cultivation realm, and spiritual root |
| **Potential** | Animated SVG ring meter showing **SSS-grade** assessment with descriptive tags |
| **Attributes** | 6 color-coded animated stat bars (STR, AGI, INT, END, SPI, CHA) |
| **Bloodline** | Dedicated Yan-Huang card with lore description and 6 inherited trait badges |
| **Techniques** | 6 skills with elemental icons, type classification, and S/A/B rank badges |
| **Background** | Narrative lore block with highlighted key terms |

### 🎨 Visual Effects
- **Floating ember particles** in the background
- **Animated stat bars** that fill on page load
- **Shimmer gradients** on legendary text and character name
- **Pulsing glow** on the bloodline tag
- **Hover interactions** on every card and skill item
- **Fully responsive** layout for mobile devices
